WEBVTT

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.890
Psychic\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPrincess

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:37.890
Psychic\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hPrincess

00:01:37.970 --> 00:01:40.350
<i>Episode 5</i>

00:01:51.930 --> 00:01:53.970
Prince Yu, Your Highness.

00:01:54.470 --> 00:01:58.770
I am here by order of Princess Lanshuang to
present you with this Xiang's grilled gluten.

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:05.890
You deemed this an important matter?

00:02:09.220 --> 00:02:11.910
This grilled gluten is a gesture
of goodwill from Her Highness,

00:02:11.910 --> 00:02:13.890
seasoned with the spiciest cumin.

00:02:14.310 --> 00:02:15.640
Please enjoy.

00:02:16.520 --> 00:02:19.390
I see. Tell my sister I am very 
grateful for her kind thoughts.

00:02:23.520 --> 00:02:24.620
A reward for you.

00:02:24.620 --> 00:02:27.200
No matter who calls today, I am indisposed!

00:02:27.200 --> 00:02:28.640
Ah, Your Highness!

00:02:45.930 --> 00:02:48.140
That Lanshuang knows how to vex me.

00:02:57.930 --> 00:03:00.610
Young maiden... let us talk.

00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:28.130
<i>This is...</i>

00:03:39.890 --> 00:03:42.610
The Western Tribe have
been acting up lately.

00:03:42.610 --> 00:03:46.280
Father trusts Qian Aotian. Naturally, 
he sent him to solve the problem.

00:03:47.140 --> 00:03:51.270
But Qian Aotian's relationship
with the Western Tribe is suspect.

00:03:51.460 --> 00:03:52.850
<i>Qian Yunshang...</i>

00:03:53.360 --> 00:03:54.940
<i>Princess Ye.</i>

00:03:55.640 --> 00:03:58.890
<i>Is she a spy sent by Qian Aotian?</i>

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:05.640
Assassin?

00:04:06.210 --> 00:04:08.270
I don't know what you're talking about!

00:04:22.520 --> 00:04:23.200
Your Highness?

00:04:24.350 --> 00:04:25.070
Your Highness?

00:04:59.430 --> 00:05:02.400
<i>Qian Yunshang. Princess Ye. </i>

00:05:03.020 --> 00:05:04.930
<i>I knew it. You came here to ruin me.</i>

00:05:19.680 --> 00:05:22.670
Prince Yu, you cannot barge in here like this.

00:05:23.140 --> 00:05:25.770
Good timing. Hand her over to me.

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:29.890
And the lies begin. You already
spirited her away, did you not?

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:31.640
What did you say?

00:05:32.420 --> 00:05:33.270
She has been taken?

00:05:34.970 --> 00:05:37.180
Who took her? Can you not even keep her safe?

00:05:39.680 --> 00:05:40.970
Playing the victim now?

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:45.170
Do not tell me this little 
spectacle is a ploy to keep her...

00:05:48.390 --> 00:05:50.820
After she disappeared, I found this.

00:05:50.820 --> 00:05:52.220
Is this not your pendant?

00:05:53.600 --> 00:05:54.720
I have mine here.

00:06:02.140 --> 00:06:05.180
These pendants were bestowed
on the princes by Father.

00:06:05.180 --> 00:06:06.720
Only two exist in the world.

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:09.850
If it is not mine,

00:06:09.850 --> 00:06:11.390
it can only be his.

00:06:46.180 --> 00:06:47.350
Ah, good.

00:06:47.620 --> 00:06:49.100
You are finally awake.

00:06:49.600 --> 00:06:50.470
You!

00:06:51.560 --> 00:06:53.660
Yes, it is I. You are right.

00:06:53.660 --> 00:06:55.930
You never thought you 
would see me again, did you?

00:06:56.810 --> 00:07:01.180
How could the noble Crown Prince kidnap me
 so underhandedly? And why am I tied up?

00:07:01.810 --> 00:07:05.320
Prince Ye and Prince Yu are fighting over you.

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:07.310
Naturally, as Crown Prince, I want to join in.

00:07:07.720 --> 00:07:11.180
That's between you guys.
I've got nothing to do with those two.

00:07:11.850 --> 00:07:13.530
Let me go now...

00:07:14.350 --> 00:07:15.890
You have much to do with them.

00:07:18.850 --> 00:07:22.340
When I was younger, I lived a carefree,
unrestrained life surrounded by beauties.

00:07:22.340 --> 00:07:25.560
I was a wild stallion, enjoying 
the prosperity I deserve!

00:07:26.770 --> 00:07:30.180
But dear Ye Youming set me 
up to be the Crown Prince.

00:07:30.600 --> 00:07:32.830
Less money, more work, no time away.

00:07:32.830 --> 00:07:35.530
Wake early, bed down late,
and liver cirrhosis on the way!

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:42.070
I will keep you here in my palace,

00:07:42.070 --> 00:07:45.120
and watch Ye Youming suffer without you.

00:07:49.100 --> 00:07:51.100
So it was that creepy Jun Yiqing.

00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:54.210
It is my fault for lowering my guard 
and allowing him to kidnap the girl...

00:07:56.680 --> 00:07:59.950
A thought occurs. A harmony has developed
between Jun Yiqing and Qian Aotian.

00:07:59.950 --> 00:08:02.440
Perhaps the incidents are related?

00:08:09.520 --> 00:08:11.540
This is quite a fetching shape actually.

00:08:11.540 --> 00:08:12.790
Untie me now!

00:08:12.790 --> 00:08:14.350
Or you'll regret it!

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:17.550
If I untied you, you would strike me.

00:08:17.970 --> 00:08:20.480
What if I give you a present?

00:08:27.850 --> 00:08:29.580
If you promise to stay...

00:08:30.600 --> 00:08:34.100
these priceless blood-jade
earrings are yours.

00:08:39.100 --> 00:08:43.840
Mistress, these blood-jade earrings 
were bestowed on me by your mother.

00:08:44.280 --> 00:08:45.900
They are the only pair in the world.

00:08:46.600 --> 00:08:50.850
I always keep them close to me to keep
them safe, so you must not play with them.

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:55.570
It seems you appreciate them.

00:08:56.100 --> 00:08:59.470
Do they stir emotion in you?
These earrings are one of a kind.

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:03.120
A nod of the head and they are yours...

00:09:04.020 --> 00:09:07.600
Might I ask Your Highness, the Crown Prince,
where he got these blood-jade earrings?

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:13.090
They were a gift from Grand Councilor Qian.

00:09:13.720 --> 00:09:15.420
Grand Councilor Qian?

00:09:16.020 --> 00:09:19.470
Then, Your Highness's relations with Grand
Councilor Qian are more than just cordial?

00:09:19.890 --> 00:09:21.070
Naturally!

00:09:21.070 --> 00:09:24.880
I am well-liked in the Imperial court.
Everyone wishes to be my friend.

00:09:28.640 --> 00:09:32.220
You might willingly accept gifts from
 Qian Aotian, but I shall not wear them.

00:09:32.850 --> 00:09:35.720
I may be Crown Prince, but no one listens to me.

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:38.220
If I had refused the gift,
he would have taken offense.

00:09:39.060 --> 00:09:41.340
Your Highness, have you
forgotten how General Nan died?

00:09:45.270 --> 00:09:47.100
I am also in a bind over it.

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:52.350
Now do you see my virtues? I am sure that you do.

00:09:53.890 --> 00:09:59.290
If you agree to stay in my palace,
 these earrings are yours.

00:10:00.140 --> 00:10:02.970
I don't want them. I am Princess Ye.

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:04.720
What... What did you say?!

00:10:12.600 --> 00:10:14.970
I am Princess Ye, Qian Yunshang.

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:25.340
Even better.

00:10:30.470 --> 00:10:33.720
My intention all along was to
rile that stony-faced Prince Ye.

00:10:33.720 --> 00:10:36.660
Today, it seems you and
I will be engaging in carnality.

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:45.720
What are you doing, Your Highness?

00:10:49.070 --> 00:10:51.250
B-B-B-Beloved wife...

00:10:51.700 --> 00:10:54.330
You did not tell me you
had a guest, Your Highness.

00:10:54.330 --> 00:10:57.220
Oh, um, I can explain. 
This is a misunderstanding.

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:01.810
Then, please, finish your story.

00:11:03.770 --> 00:11:04.720
Trouble, Highness!

00:11:03.770 --> 00:11:04.720
My hair! My hair!

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:08.070
Prince Ye and Prince Yu 
have barged into the palace!

00:11:19.060 --> 00:11:20.710
Bring her out here, Jun Yiqing.

00:11:21.680 --> 00:11:22.770
Give me back the girl.

00:11:24.890 --> 00:11:27.890
Of what do you speak? 
I do not understand what you mean.

00:11:38.770 --> 00:11:39.770
Look familiar?

00:11:39.940 --> 00:11:43.000
Oh! Is this not your pendant, Prince Ye?

00:11:43.850 --> 00:11:46.640
How could you so carelessly misplace it?

00:11:49.310 --> 00:11:50.770
Mine is here.

00:11:51.470 --> 00:11:57.270
Only you would abduct her so ineptly, and seek
to stoke distrust between Brother Ye and me.

00:11:57.930 --> 00:12:00.910
Heaven and earth bear
witness to my love for my wife.

00:12:00.910 --> 00:12:03.830
Do not cast these false accusations at me.

00:12:03.830 --> 00:12:05.270
Is that not true, dear wife?

00:12:05.680 --> 00:12:07.550
I saw her here only moments ago.

00:12:17.520 --> 00:12:21.640
I-It is a long and <i>complicated</i> story.

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:23.140
Show us to her.

00:12:32.140 --> 00:12:37.140
I, uh... Like I said, she is not here.
Why do you not believe me?

00:12:39.350 --> 00:12:41.890
It grows late. I still have 
matters to attend to.

00:12:52.850 --> 00:12:55.380
One last time. Where is she?

00:12:57.060 --> 00:12:57.910
Where is she?

00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:05.180
I see. So she is indeed Princess Ye, your wife.

00:13:05.180 --> 00:13:06.020
"Princess"?

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:10.290
Why are you so concerned? Is it because
 you wish to find your enemy's daughter?

00:13:10.290 --> 00:13:12.830
Or do you have feelings for her now?

00:13:12.830 --> 00:13:15.520
You must know of Qian Aotian's
relationship with the Western Tribe.

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:19.710
That is between me and my princess.
It is certainly no business of yours.

00:13:21.140 --> 00:13:22.520
Princess...

00:13:23.060 --> 00:13:24.890
If you are tired of living...

00:13:26.140 --> 00:13:27.640
I can remedy that.

00:13:30.310 --> 00:13:31.370
Do it!

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:34.640
Kill me, then you can have
the title of Crown Prince back.

00:13:37.310 --> 00:13:41.140
I promise you, His Highness truly
does not know where Princess Ye is.

00:13:41.620 --> 00:13:44.600
Princess...

00:13:49.020 --> 00:13:51.270
She was in this room a moment ago.

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:56.370
We left her here. Then, when we came 
back with you, she had disappeared.

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:02.020
My dear wife still loves me.

00:14:02.280 --> 00:14:03.110
Is this true?

00:14:04.430 --> 00:14:07.520
I saw her with my own eyes. I would not lie to you.

00:14:07.520 --> 00:14:09.390
Release me. Take your hands off me...

00:14:10.930 --> 00:14:12.980
As your wife vouches for you...

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:17.660
We are leaving.

00:14:21.520 --> 00:14:23.320
Shoo, shoo, shoo. Get out, get out.

00:14:23.320 --> 00:14:24.390
Be quiet.

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:37.310
Good to go!

00:14:43.680 --> 00:14:47.230
Mistress Yunxi, are we really 
going to leave like this?

00:14:51.390 --> 00:14:54.800
Auntie Xue always kept these with her.

00:14:55.270 --> 00:14:57.780
But the Crown Prince received
them as a gift, so I'm worried...

00:15:00.470 --> 00:15:03.390
Since Father didn't keep his word
and take care of Auntie Xue,

00:15:03.770 --> 00:15:05.730
I no longer have to be Princess Ye.

00:15:11.060 --> 00:15:11.930
Let's go home.

00:15:12.400 --> 00:15:15.230
Once we find Auntie Xue, 
we can leave this place forever.

00:15:31.600 --> 00:15:33.450
Grand Councilor Qian is holding a feast?

00:15:39.100 --> 00:15:39.890
Yes.

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:46.060
We all know that you are the de facto
leader of the Western Tribe, Lord Beitang.

00:15:46.600 --> 00:15:49.790
To maintain the everlasting
friendship between our nations,

00:15:49.790 --> 00:15:52.480
Grand Councilor Qian hopes you can attend.

00:15:54.560 --> 00:15:57.180
Then, how can I refuse his offer?

00:15:58.350 --> 00:15:59.740
I, Lord Beitang...

00:16:02.720 --> 00:16:04.010
...will attend this feast.

00:17:42.890 --> 00:17:45.180
House of Grand Councilor

00:17:44.640 --> 00:17:47.540
Yuchui, hurry. The feast is about to begin.

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:49.250
My lady, you look most beautiful.

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:53.150
Lord Beitang will undoubtedly 
fall for your charms today.

00:17:55.600 --> 00:17:57.930
I deserve death. Please 
do not be angry, my lady.

00:17:58.850 --> 00:18:01.170
Lord Beitang is the head 
of the Western Tribe.

00:18:01.170 --> 00:18:03.890
Who would want attention
from a barbarian like him?

00:18:04.320 --> 00:18:05.620
Fetch my lipstick.

00:18:05.620 --> 00:18:06.360
Yes, my lady.

00:18:09.720 --> 00:18:13.980
Lord Beitang, be in no doubt:
your heart belongs to me.
